T*
(Every employee gets 24 days of paid leave per calendar year, credited at 2 days per) Tj
T*
(month.) Tj
T*
T*
(Up to 10 unused paid leave days can be carried forward to the next year. The rest lapse) Tj
T*
(on 31 December.) Tj
T*
T*
(Sick leave is separate: 12 days per year. A doctor's note is required for sick leave) Tj
T*
(longer than 2 days.) Tj
T*
T*
(Parental leave is 26 weeks for the birthing parent and 6 weeks for the other parent.) Tj
T*
T*
(Leave requests must be raised in the HR portal at least 7 days in advance, except sick) Tj
T*
(leave.) Tj
T*
